Package: proton-autogen
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, coreutils, desktop-file-utils
Recommends: wine, gamemode
Description: Automatic Proton launcher for Windows executables
 Proton-Autogen automatically launches Windows executables using Proton
 when available, and falls back to Wine if needed.
